WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.091
Rachel: I'm bored, Ricky.

2
00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:11.599
It's raining too much. Ricky:

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.415
It's raining because it's spring.

4
00:00:14.416 --> 00:00:17.474
It always rains in the spring. Rachel:

5
00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:19.319
Why? Ricky:

6
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:25.598
It rains because the flowers need water to grow.

7
00:00:25.599 --> 00:00:28.903
Rachel: Even Bingo is bored.

8
00:00:28.904 --> 00:00:32.773
Ricky: Come on, Rachel. Let's play

9
00:00:32.774 --> 00:00:37.147
outside. Put on your raincoat.

10
00:00:37.148 --> 00:00:41.350
Rachel: Ricky, take an umbrella.

11
00:00:41.351 --> 00:00:43.677
Ricky: I don't need an umbrella.

12
00:00:43.678 --> 00:00:49.639
It's not raining that hard.

13
00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:53.704
Maybe I do need an umbrella. Rachel:

14
00:00:53.705 --> 00:01:05.414
He-he! Here you go. Look,

15
00:01:05.415 --> 00:01:11.488
Ricky. It's a little river in our backyard. Ricky:

16
00:01:11.489 --> 00:01:16.792
This is fun! Come on in, Rachel. I

17
00:01:16.793 --> 00:01:19.182
wish we had little boats. Rachel:

18
00:01:19.183 --> 00:01:24.884
Just a minute, Ricky. Ricky:

19
00:01:24.885 --> 00:01:29.207
Cool, Rachel! Where did you get the boats? Rachel:

20
00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:32.114
We made them in kindergarten.

21
00:01:32.115 --> 00:01:35.754
Ricky: Thanks, Rachel! Let's race.

22
00:01:35.755 --> 00:01:41.534
Ready, Rachel? One, two, three, go! Rachel:

23
00:01:41.535 --> 00:01:50.161
Woo-hoo! Ricky, this is fun! Can we race again?

